<p>Focus thermal energy and strike an enemy for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">117%, 144%, 166%, 184%, 200%</acronym> weapon damage as cold.</p><p>A burst of cold will then engulf them, doing an extra <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> Cold damage and also freeze them for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>If the attack freezes a pinned creature a burst of ice is summoned, circling the caster and the creature with a wall of ice for 3 turns.</p><p>The cold burst damage will scale with your Mindpower.</p>